[{"answer":"Hello, West Bay Hotel. Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm ringing about your advertisement in the Evening Gazette.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that the one for temporary staff?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid the person who's dealing with that isn't in today,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/7.mp3"},{"answer":"but I can give you the main details if you like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me what kind of staff you are looking for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/10.mp3"},{"answer":"We're looking for waiters at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/11.mp3"},{"answer":"There was one post for a cook, but that's already been taken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the hours of work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/14.mp3"},{"answer":"There are two different shifts -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/15.mp3"},{"answer":"there's a day shift from 7 to 2","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and a late shift from 4 till 11.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And can people choose which one they want to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Not normally, because everyone would choose the day shift I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/19.mp3"},{"answer":"You alternate from one week to another.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. I'm just writing all this down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/21.mp3"},{"answer":"What about time off?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/22.mp3"},{"answer":"You get one day off","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think you can negotiate which one you want,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/24.mp3"},{"answer":"it's more or less up to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/25.mp3"},{"answer":"But it has to be the same one every week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know what the rates of pay are?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've got them here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/28.mp3"},{"answer":"You get £5.50 an hour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and that includes a break.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Do I have to go home to eat or...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/31.mp3"},{"answer":"You don't have to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/32.mp3"},{"answer":"You can get a meal in the hotel if you want to,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's no charge for it so you might as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, so let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd get er..., 221, no, no, £231 a week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd also get tips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Our guests tend to be quite generous.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm, is there a uniform?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/40.mp3"},{"answer":"What about clothes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I forgot to mention that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/42.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to wear a white shirt, just a plain one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and dark trousers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/44.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, not green or anything like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And we don't supply those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That's okay, I've got trousers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd just have to buy a couple of shirts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/48.mp3"},{"answer":"What about anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Do I need a waistcoat or anything?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/50.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to wear a jacket, but the hotel lends you that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/52.mp3"},{"answer":"One last thing - I don't know what the starting date is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Just a minute, I think it's sometime around the end of June.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the 28th, in time for the summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/55.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great. I'm available from the 10th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you can call again you need to speak to the Service Manager.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Her name's Jane Urwin,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/59.mp3"},{"answer":"that's URWIN,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and she'll probably arrange to meet you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And when's the best time to ring?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you call tomorrow?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/64.mp3"},{"answer":"She usually starts checking the rooms at midday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/65.mp3"},{"answer":"so before then if you can, so she'll have more time to chat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just give you her number because she's got a direct line.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/68.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 832009.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/69.mp3"},{"answer":"823009?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/70.mp3"},{"answer":"832.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'll do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/73.mp3"},{"answer":"And by the way, she will ask you for a reference,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/74.mp3"},{"answer":"so you might like to be thinking about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/75.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, just someone who knows you and can vouch for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks very much for your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/78.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-1-2023-07-27-13-01-28/81.mp3"}]
